# The Today pane hiding completed was on the second entry; another program completes it while the app is closed, and on reopening the focus is on the entry after it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today})
END
keys gt gc j
quit
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today})
END
restart
see 󰖙 Today
see ▌ - Plan sprint  Work
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today}) @done({today})
END
